This directory holds the .sf2 soundbanks the Magenta sample sets are rendered
from. It is expected to exist; its contents are not tracked.

  <name>.sf2      any General MIDI soundbank

Not tracked because a full GM bank is ~310 MB — over GitHub's 100 MB blob limit,
so it cannot be pushed at all. Download one and drop it in, or upload it through
the "Magenta sound font generator" dev tool, which puts it here.

What is rendered from it lands in ../magenta-sound-font, beside it, and reaches
each app through a symlink made by `npm run setup:symlinks`. See that folder's
.gitinfo for the command.
